    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You were trained by the Warning Guild of House Medani to spot deception, anticipate ambush, and piece together fractured clues. You carry the prophetic vigilance of the Mark of Detection.</p><p>Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to <strong>Intelligence</strong> or <strong>Wisdom</strong>, and one is a free attribute boost.</p><p>You're trained in the <strong>Deception</strong> skill and the <strong>House Medani Lore</strong> skill. You gain the <strong>Lie to Me</strong> skill feat. You have access to Mark of Detection feats.</p>"
